Subject: [PATCH] media: sunxi: add cedrus-enc (Cedrus with H.264 encoder) for V831

Bootlin's rework of the staging Cedrus driver into decoder/encoder procs with
the H.264 encoder (github.com/bootlin/linux cedrus/h264-encoding), on the V831 video
engine. Separate from staging VIDEO_SUNXI_CEDRUS; module cedrus-enc.

---
